{
  "bookId": "hero-211205",
  "id": "bond-43801",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43801001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "|101|……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "怎么还没醒，戳一下试试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801003",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "脸颊上传来了清晰的触感。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43801005",
              "text": "……？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43801005",
              "text": "发生什么事了？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43801004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "那个……昨天你不是答应和我一起修行的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43801007",
              "text": "有吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43801007",
              "text": "好像是有这么一回事。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43801006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "请快点起床，洗漱用品都备好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一段时间后……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "首先请照着我做，双脚开立，微微屈膝，平举双手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43801011",
              "text": "好的。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43801011",
              "text": "看起来不难。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43801010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "而后左脚朝左侧迈出一步，上身顺势左转，同时……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "再是……然后……最后……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "汐音自然流畅地完成了一套动作，回到了起手式。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "这一式名为「野马分鬃」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43801016",
              "text": "我跟上了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43801015",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "你学得很快，接下来我们还有很多时间可以慢慢练习。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43801018",
              "text": "这就是「太极」？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43801017",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "嗯，爷爷说过，太极并不是一门让人称霸的武术，而是教人如何求得内外统一，因循自然的修身之法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43801020",
              "text": "我懂了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43801020",
              "text": "原来学了不能打十个吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43801019",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43801020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "就这样，和汐音一起的太极拳修行成为了早晨的例行活动。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
